			],
			"Message": "chore(Project): Update SideCar and Worker submodules to current revision\n\nSync the SideCar (extension host sidecar) and Worker (frontend web worker) submodules to their latest revisions on the Current branch.\n\n**SideCar:** Update from ac3bb57 to b751b77. This merge incorporates recent changes to the extension runtime environment and maintains alignment with the updated gRPC interface definitions in Mountain.\n\n**Worker:** Update from c404059 to 948a811. This pull includes necessary adjustments to the web worker execution context to support the latest Wind service layer events.\n\nThese updates ensure the editor's sidecar processes and background workers remain synchronized with the core application state and recent architectural refinements.",
			"SHA": "5a906127d4ef6b0f368bd3c3cd0df9d87155f31d"
		},
